<title>UK: TENNIS-SELES OUT OF WIMBLEDON.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SELES OUT OF WIMBLEDON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second seed Monica Seles was knocked out of Wimbledon in the third round on Monday when she was beaten 0-6 6-4 8-6 by Sandrine Testud of France.</p>
</text>
